          <h2 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-extrabold text-white flex items-center space-x-2">
            <i data-lucide="layers" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>Speaking Skills Bank</span>
            <span id="selected-counter" class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-400 ml-2">(1 selected)</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">
            Click pills to toggle selection. Click <strong>Combine</strong> to deploy into Phase 1 (Knowledge). Drag them rightwards into autonomous habit to relieve capacity!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <button onclick="toggleAllSkills(false)" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 rounded-lg transition font-medium">
            Clear
          </button>
          
          <button id="btn-combine" onclick="combinePills()" class="px-5 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-extrabold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-indigo-500 active:scale-95 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/25 transition-all flex items-center space-x-2">
            <i data-lucide="merge" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
